				<text_box x="33.3517" y="78" width="468.186" height="172.725">&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;meta charset=&quot;utf-8&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
hr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }
li.unchecked::marker { content: &quot;\2610&quot;; }
li.checked::marker { content: &quot;\2612&quot;; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Segoe UI&apos;; font-size:9pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:14pt; font-weight:700; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Scenario&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:14pt; font-weight:700; color:#050505;&quot;&gt; 3: Increase PrEP Initiation by 20% (S3)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-family:&apos;.AppleSystemUIFont&apos;; font-size:13pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:11pt; color:#050505;&quot;&gt;To examine the impact of increasing PrEP Initiation by 20% compared to the Base Case (S1), first &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:11pt; font-weight:700; color:#0c31ef;&quot;&gt;Reset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:11pt; color:#050505;&quot;&gt; the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:11pt; font-weight:700; color:#050505;&quot;&gt;OUTREACH&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:11pt; color:#050505;&quot;&gt; slider back to 1.0. Next, set the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:11pt; font-weight:700; color:#050505;&quot;&gt;INITIATION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:11pt; color:#050505;&quot;&gt; slider to 1.2. Now click &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:11pt; font-weight:700; color:#0c31ef;&quot;&gt;Run&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:11pt; color:#050505;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:11pt; color:#050505;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;.AppleSystemUIFont&apos;; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;Use the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;.AppleSystemUIFont&apos;; font-size:11pt; font-weight:700; color:#0c31ef;&quot;&gt;drop down box&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;.AppleSystemUIFont&apos;; font-size:11pt; color:#0c31ef;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;.AppleSystemUIFont&apos;; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;in the figure to the right to see results for different variables. When ready, click &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:11pt; font-weight:700; color:#0c31ef;&quot;&gt;Next Page&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;.AppleSystemUIFont&apos;; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</text_box>
				<isee:annotation background="#CEF0FF" popup_background_color="#DEF5FF" highlight_on_open="true" popup_font_weight="bold" popup_font_color="white" launcher_label="?" show_by_default="false" hide_launcher="false" launch_on_hover="true" x="325.397" y="259.077" width="29.7367" height="25.3846">
					<popup x="168.557" y="138.67" width="224.929" height="134.615">
						<text>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;meta charset=&quot;utf-8&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
hr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }
li.unchecked::marker { content: &quot;\2610&quot;; }
li.checked::marker { content: &quot;\2612&quot;; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Segoe UI&apos;; font-size:9pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:10pt; font-weight:700; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;What was the impact of our strategy?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:10pt; font-weight:700; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:10pt; font-weight:700; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Q1. PrEP Sustainers percent change: Record the base case value for PrEP sustainers and your best run 12 months into the future.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; Compute the percent change ((new value-old value/old value)*100)? &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:10pt; font-weight:700; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Q2. PrEP quitter’s percent change: Record the base case value for PrEP quitters and your best run 12 months into the future.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; Compute the percent change ((new value-old value/old value)*100)? &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:10pt; font-weight:700; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Q3. HIV incidence rate (new positive cases): Record the base case value for HIV incidence and your best run 12 months into the future. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Compute the percent change ((new value-old value/old value)*100)?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:10pt; font-weight:700; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;Tip:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:10pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt; You can compute this value for any stock or flow variable in the model! &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:10pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:10pt; font-weight:700; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt;Tip:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:10pt; color:#0000ff;&quot;&gt; Time series data for your runs can be downloaded to a spreadsheet. Contact us for assistance!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</text>
					</popup>
				</isee:annotation>
