				<text_box appearance="transparent" x="35.1099" y="74.2857" width="455.715" height="196.571">&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;meta charset=&quot;utf-8&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
hr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }
li.unchecked::marker { content: &quot;\2610&quot;; }
li.checked::marker { content: &quot;\2612&quot;; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Segoe UI&apos;; font-size:9pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;.AppleSystemUIFont&apos;; font-size:14pt; font-weight:700; color:#060404;&quot;&gt;Scenario 4: Increase PrEP Retention by 20% (S4)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-family:&apos;.AppleSystemUIFont&apos;; font-size:14pt; font-weight:700; color:#060404;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;.AppleSystemUIFont&apos;; font-size:11pt; color:#060404;&quot;&gt;To examine the impact of increasing PrEP Retention by 20% compared to the Base Case (S1), &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;.AppleSystemUIFont&apos;; font-size:11pt; font-weight:700; color:#0c31ef;&quot;&gt;Reset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;.AppleSystemUIFont&apos;; font-size:11pt; color:#060404;&quot;&gt; the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;.AppleSystemUIFont&apos;; font-size:11pt; font-weight:700; color:#060404;&quot;&gt;INITIATION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;.AppleSystemUIFont&apos;; font-size:11pt; color:#060404;&quot;&gt; slider back to 1.0. Next, change the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;.AppleSystemUIFont&apos;; font-size:11pt; font-weight:700; color:#060404;&quot;&gt;RETENTION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;.AppleSystemUIFont&apos;; font-size:11pt; color:#060404;&quot;&gt; slider to 0.80. Now click &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;.AppleSystemUIFont&apos;; font-size:11pt; font-weight:700; color:#0c31ef;&quot;&gt;Run&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;.AppleSystemUIFont&apos;; font-size:11pt; color:#0c31ef;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-family:&apos;.AppleSystemUIFont&apos;; font-size:11pt; color:#060404;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;.AppleSystemUIFont&apos;; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;Use the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;.AppleSystemUIFont&apos;; font-size:11pt; font-weight:700; color:#0c31ef;&quot;&gt;drop down box&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;.AppleSystemUIFont&apos;; font-size:11pt; color:#0c31ef;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;.AppleSystemUIFont&apos;; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;in the figure to the right to see results for different variables. When ready, click &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Arial&apos;; font-size:11pt; font-weight:700; color:#0c31ef;&quot;&gt;Next Page&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:&apos;.AppleSystemUIFont&apos;; font-size:11pt;&quot;&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</text_box>
